x", "label": "Annual parallax (Gould 2004 geocentric)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "t0_par fixed at preliminary non-parallax t0; delta_s precomputed once since it is an astropy ephemeris query."}, {"id": "claude_student_t_likelihood", "label": "Student-t robust likelihood (scale, dof free)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Residuals globally heavier-than-Gaussian rather than discrete outliers, so smooth down-weighting beats Huber/sigma-clipping."}, {"id": "claude_huber_likelihood", "label": "Huber loss likelihood (DELTA=1.345)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_error_bar_rescaling", "label": "Per-instrument error-bar rescaling k", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "k^2 = sum r^2/(sigma^2+e_min^2)/(N-n); no error floor since bright end under-contributes."}, {"id": "claude_bic_model_comparison", "label": "PSPL vs 2L1S BIC comparison", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_calibrate_once_then_fit", "label": "O-03-BLG235 calibrate-once-then-fit pipeline", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Freezes flux calibration at point estimate; posterior tighter than full joint fit."}, {"id": "claude_u0_sign_degeneracy", "label": "u0 sign degeneracy / required u0_guess", "file_t